extends ../layouts/default.pug
include ../mixins/index.pug

block main
  +page-banner({ name: pageTitle }, "/privacy-policy")

  section.mt_80.mb_100
    .container
      .row.justify-content-center
        .col-lg-8
          p(style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:32px;") Last updated: September 7, 2026

          h2(style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px;") 1. Information We Collect
          p(style="color:var(--ink);line-height:1.8;") We collect information you provide when creating an account, placing an order, or contacting us - including your name, email address, phone number, and shipping address. We also collect browsing data to improve your experience.

          h2(style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:28px 0 12px;") 2. How We Use Your Information
          p(style="color:var(--ink);line-height:1.8;") Your information is used to process orders, send order updates, provide customer support, and improve our services. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.

          h2(style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:28px 0 12px;") 3. Cookies
          p(style="color:var(--ink);line-height:1.8;") We use cookies to keep you logged in, remember your cart, and analyze site traffic. You may disable cookies in your browser settings, though some features may not function correctly.

          h2(style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:28px 0 12px;") 4. Data Security
          p(style="color:var(--ink);line-height:1.8;") We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information. Passwords are encrypted and never stored in plain text.

          h2(style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:28px 0 12px;") 5. User Data Deletion Instructions
          p(style="color:var(--ink);line-height:1.8;") According to Facebook platform rules, users have the right to request deletion of their activities and data. If you would like to request data deletion for your account or Facebook login data, you can remove our application from your Facebook account via Settings &amp; Privacy &gt; Settings &gt; Apps and Websites, or request full deletion of your user profile and associated data by contacting us directly. We will process and permanently remove your data within 30 days of receiving your request.

          h2(style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:28px 0 12px;") 6. Contact
          p(style="color:var(--ink);line-height:1.8;")
            | For privacy-related questions, contact us at 
            if storeContact.email
              a(href=`mailto:${storeContact.email}` style="color:var(--gold);")= storeContact.email
              | .
            else
              a(href="/contact" style="color:var(--gold);") our contact page
              | .
